; XAU_Sniper_DemoTurbo
; DEMO WATCHING ONLY. Roughly 10x the trades of the default (about 3-4 a day on M15 in simulation) at somewhat lower quality (about -0.06R to -0.10R per trade versus the default thresholds).
; Needs a demo account: the guardrails only warn there. On a real account every protection stays on and this preset is far too loose. Small demo balances: 0.01 lot may risk several % per trade.
; Load via the EA inputs dialog: Load. Symbol XAUUSD, timeframe M5 or M15.
